  {
    "name": "task_start_screen",
    "description": "Read the last 30 lines of the terminal tab a task's agent did not start in, while its computer keeps that tab (a supervision message says until when): the question the tab's shell waits on, or where the agent's own screen stopped. Only for a task of this conversation whose start is being remedied; what it shows stays here, it is not kept with the task.",
    "input_schema": {
      "type": "object",
