          "type": "string",
          "description": "the task's id, from the supervision message"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "why it should start now, in the user's language, one sentence"
        },
        "launcher": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "optional: another launcher of that computer, as the supervision message lists"
        },
        "model": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "with launcher: a model id (default: its own)"
        }
      }
    },
    "defer_loading": true
  },
  {
    "name": "todo_workspace",
    "description": "Manage an explicitly requested backend workspace for one to-do. Legacy Engine creation and folder reuse stay available. inspect reads saved and live state. First prepare needs operation_id, machine_id, layout and selected_repo_ids from todo_repositories_get; all selected repos must be ready. Inspect unknown outcomes before retrying the same operation. To correct a branch/path, cancel, edit associations or naming, then prepare the same to-do with a new operation_id. Unchanged successful repos and local work survive; conflicting resources need explicit cleanup. Cleanup removes worktrees and retains branches by default. Use force (discards unsaved work) or delete_branch only for that explicitly requested effect. Prepare after cleanup with a new operation_id. No action starts an Agent or changes the to-do stage.",
