  {
    "name": "todo_list",
    "description": "List Persona to-dos (not Feishu tasks): open/failed starts by default, open first, then newest first. Returns id, title/state, project, reminder, agents and first note line; times use the user's time zone. Filter by the schema fields. Find an id here before edits; use todo_get for details.",
